{"sections":[{"slug":"焊接形式","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"焊接形式"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">焊接形式</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"焊接形式"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>, $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为微分流形</span>, $E\\to M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是以</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">为纤维</span>, $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为结构群的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维丛</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">假设</span> $G$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/传递作用","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">传递</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">地作用于</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $F$ (<span lang=\"zh\">作为流形</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的维数与</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">相同</span>. <strong><span lang=\"zh\">焊接形式</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">由如下资料给出</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">特殊截面</span> $o\\colon M\\to E$;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">线性同构</span> $\\theta \\colon TM \\to o^* VE$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $VE$ <span lang=\"zh\">表示</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">的垂直丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即由</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的垂直向量</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即纤维方向的切向量</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">构成的丛</span>, $o^*VE$ <span lang=\"zh\">是沿着特殊截面</span> $o$ <span lang=\"zh\">的垂直向量构成的向量丛</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这样</span>, $\\theta$ <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">的垂直切空间等同于切空间</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>, $V$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">表示</span>. <strong><span lang=\"zh\">焊接形式</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是一个</span> $V$-<span lang=\"zh\">取值的水平</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">等变</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">形式</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}